tiple-gens"],"notes":[{"content":"[New global model?] [NO] The Solara was developed as a coupe and convertible derivative of the Toyota Camry rather than as a primary standalone global model.\n[Rebadged model?] [NO] The Solara featured unique sheet metal and body styling rather than being a simple badge-engineered version of another model.\n[Bodystyle variation?] [YES] The model was marketed as the coupe and convertible bodystyle variation of the Toyota Camry mid-size sedan.\n[Multiple generations?] [YES] The Toyota Solara was produced in two distinct generations based on the XV20 and XV30 Camry platforms respectively.\n[Other names?] [NO] The model was sold primarily in North America and was not rebadged under other brands or nameplates in other markets.","userId":"llm-bot","createdAt":"2026-02-05T20:36:11.434Z"}],"modeloUrlSafe":"solara","marcaUrlSafe":"toyota","denunciasCount":12};
